    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f About This Game \u2013 <i>Cosmic Caf\u00e9</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the new owner of the once-legendary <i>Cosmic Caf\u00e9</i>. With the previous owner missing and the galaxy ravaged by a ruthless corporate overlord, Take charge and restore the caf\u00e9 to its former glory and discover the mystery behind your new and unexpected role.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Manage &amp; Upgrade Your Caf\u00e9</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/227d0d16e6f890d35a447206f7c0b4a8.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/227d0d16e6f890d35a447206f7c0b4a8.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/227d0d16e6f890d35a447206f7c0b4a8.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Bring this forgotten caf\u00e9 back to life with new machines, d\u00e9cor, and custom asteroid biomes. Upgrade your kitchen and cafe tools to serve up exotic dishes and premium services\u00a0  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded Explore Biomes &amp; Gather Ingredients<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/553e377311e39e73ccfe278f7cfebf0b.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/553e377311e39e73ccfe278f7cfebf0b.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/553e377311e39e73ccfe278f7cfebf0b.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through artificial biomes to collect rare alien ingredients for your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Transform Your DNA &amp; Adapt<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/10921eefea62bcb49cef79be63869a15.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/10921eefea62bcb49cef79be63869a15.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/10921eefea62bcb49cef79be63869a15.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Cafe's advanced technology to Harvest DNA from mutated lifeforms and transform yourself, unlocking new powers for traversal, combat, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc7d Rescue and Serve your Customers<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/1b68a94a60b8c65672586d721c03b193.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/1b68a94a60b8c65672586d721c03b193.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/1b68a94a60b8c65672586d721c03b193.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gecks\u2014a once peaceful native species \u2014have been taxed and brainwashed into servitude.\u00a0 Rescue them and turn them into loyal caf\u00e9 customers, while creating strange alien dishes and keeping your shop stocked!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2696\ufe0f Fight Back Against the Galactic Revenue Service<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/0288d7117497ab221f4d55af24d07030.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/0288d7117497ab221f4d55af24d07030.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/0288d7117497ab221f4d55af24d07030.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Revenue Service will stop at nothing to shut you down. Master alien-level tax evasion and defend your caf\u00e9 from surprise audits, sabotage, and raids while uncovering the truth behind their grip on the universe. Use the cafe to grow your power and influence and stop them here.\u00a0<br><br><u><strong>About the Developer</strong></u><br>I\u2019m Michael, a solo game developer who began my journey as a 3D artist, collaborating with studios to craft unique art styles and immersive worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Caf\u00e9 grew from my love of sci-fi and \u201990s cartoons, and my love for games where you can both run a shop and gear up to battle monsters. Set in a bizarre, handcrafted space environment, it\u2019s a world where creativity, chaos, and weird alien cuisine collide. Cosmic Caf\u00e9 is the passion project I always wanted to play, and now, I\u2019m excited to share it with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f About This Game \u2013 <i>Cosmic Caf\u00e9</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the new owner of the once-legendary <i>Cosmic Caf\u00e9</i>. With the previous owner missing and the galaxy ravaged by a ruthless corporate overlord, Take charge and restore the caf\u00e9 to its former glory and discover the mystery behind your new and unexpected role.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Manage &amp; Upgrade Your Caf\u00e9</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/227d0d16e6f890d35a447206f7c0b4a8.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/227d0d16e6f890d35a447206f7c0b4a8.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/227d0d16e6f890d35a447206f7c0b4a8.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Bring this forgotten caf\u00e9 back to life with new machines, d\u00e9cor, and custom asteroid biomes. Upgrade your kitchen and cafe tools to serve up exotic dishes and premium services\u00a0  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udded Explore Biomes &amp; Gather Ingredients<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/553e377311e39e73ccfe278f7cfebf0b.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/553e377311e39e73ccfe278f7cfebf0b.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/553e377311e39e73ccfe278f7cfebf0b.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through artificial biomes to collect rare alien ingredients for your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea Transform Your DNA &amp; Adapt<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/10921eefea62bcb49cef79be63869a15.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/10921eefea62bcb49cef79be63869a15.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/10921eefea62bcb49cef79be63869a15.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Cafe's advanced technology to Harvest DNA from mutated lifeforms and transform yourself, unlocking new powers for traversal, combat, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc7d Rescue and Serve your Customers<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/1b68a94a60b8c65672586d721c03b193.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/1b68a94a60b8c65672586d721c03b193.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/1b68a94a60b8c65672586d721c03b193.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gecks\u2014a once peaceful native species \u2014have been taxed and brainwashed into servitude.\u00a0 Rescue them and turn them into loyal caf\u00e9 customers, while creating strange alien dishes and keeping your shop stocked!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2696\ufe0f Fight Back Against the Galactic Revenue Service<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/0288d7117497ab221f4d55af24d07030.poster.avif?t=1753984332\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/0288d7117497ab221f4d55af24d07030.webm?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318190/extras/0288d7117497ab221f4d55af24d07030.mp4?t=1753984332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Galactic Revenue Service will stop at nothing to shut you down. Master alien-level tax evasion and defend your caf\u00e9 from surprise audits, sabotage, and raids while uncovering the truth behind their grip on the universe. Use the cafe to grow your power and influence and stop them here.\u00a0<br><br><u><strong>About the Developer</strong></u><br>I\u2019m Michael, a solo game developer who began my journey as a 3D artist, collaborating with studios to craft unique art styles and immersive worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Caf\u00e9 grew from my love of sci-fi and \u201990s cartoons, and my love for games where you can both run a shop and gear up to battle monsters. Set in a bizarre, handcrafted space environment, it\u2019s a world where creativity, chaos, and weird alien cuisine collide. Cosmic Caf\u00e9 is the passion project I always wanted to play, and now, I\u2019m excited to share it with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
